{
  "id": "forensics-chain-custody",
  "workdir": "/home/student/task",
  "hostname": "lab",
  "expect": {
    "file": "/home/student/task/found.txt",
    "contains": "nto{ch41n_0f_cust0dy_1nt4ct}"
  },
  "fs": [
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task",
      "type": "dir"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/task.md",
      "text": "# Задача: целостность цепочки хранения\n\n`laptop.img` + `image.sha256` — образ и его хеш; `custody.log` — журнал передач улики.\n\n1. Проверь образ: `sha256sum -c image.sha256`.\n2. Проверь цепочку HMAC-связей: `python3 custody_verify.py`.\n\nФлаг `nto{...}` — `sealed note` последней записи. Запиши его в `found.txt`.\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/laptop.img",
      "b64": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/image.sha256",
      "text": "238e2e2c64c0f0ea5d0c7740fb489b779ab6074910f02e7711eff76de67e7cd5  laptop.img\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/custody.log",
      "text": "E001|2026-03-01T10:00:00Z|Ivanov|seized|laptop Lenovo S/N PF12345||296d3acf2e601879bc67c175556e0ccded10de5726b1505ab12ef74c3fd92624\nE002|2026-03-01T10:15:00Z|Ivanov|imaged|dc3dd sha256=238e2e2c64c0f0ea|296d3acf2e601879bc67c175556e0ccded10de5726b1505ab12ef74c3fd92624|f5f1d573b6f0854ccf2e98aa78090a082bdacd002b2dd856a1106826d1c666f7\nE003|2026-03-01T11:00:00Z|Petrov|received|analyst workstation|f5f1d573b6f0854ccf2e98aa78090a082bdacd002b2dd856a1106826d1c666f7|bbf0e5a04773af7a25aa96e334ca10d66144aaf53fff4c853fc98d6fe6d20ce3\nE004|2026-03-02T09:00:00Z|Petrov|sealed|nto{ch41n_0f_cust0dy_1nt4ct}|bbf0e5a04773af7a25aa96e334ca10d66144aaf53fff4c853fc98d6fe6d20ce3|0805632d7a583a0784a623d28cf18a0ee7d9d34c3870a4ce0aefaf8a77112c9b\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/custody_verify.py",
      "text": "#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# Verify an HMAC-linked chain-of-custody log; report the first broken link.\nimport hmac, hashlib\nkey = b\"custody-hmac-key\"\nprev = \"\"\nok = True\nfor ln in open(\"custody.log\"):\n    ln = ln.rstrip(\"\\n\")\n    if not ln:\n        continue\n    eid, ts, who, act, note, p, mac = ln.split(\"|\")\n    calc = hmac.new(key, \"|\".join([eid, ts, who, act, note, p]).encode(),\n                    hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\n    good = (calc == mac) and (p == prev)\n    print(\"%s %-8s %-9s %s\" % (eid, act, who, \"OK\" if good else \"TAMPERED\"))\n    if not good:\n        ok = False\n    prev = mac\nprint(\"chain intact:\", ok)\nprint(\"sealed note:\", note)\n"
    }
  ],
  "tools": {
    "python3": {
      "help": "python3 <скрипт.py> — интерпретатор Python (вывод захвачен из реального запуска)",
      "cases": [
        {
          "match": "--version|^-V$",
          "example": "python3 --version",
          "output": "Python 3.12.4"
        },
        {
          "match": "custody_verify\\.py",
          "example": "python3 custody_verify.py",
          "output": "E001 seized   Ivanov    OK\nE002 imaged   Ivanov    OK\nE003 received Petrov    OK\nE004 sealed   Petrov    OK\nchain intact: True\nsealed note: nto{ch41n_0f_cust0dy_1nt4ct}\n"
        }
      ],
      "fallback": "python3: доступно `python3 custody_verify.py`\n"
    },
    "sha256sum": {
      "help": "sha256sum [-c] <файл> — SHA-256 хеш / проверка",
      "cases": [
        {
          "match": "\\-c\\s+image\\.sha256",
          "example": "sha256sum -c image.sha256",
          "output": "laptop.img: OK\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "laptop\\.img",
          "example": "sha256sum laptop.img",
          "output": "238e2e2c64c0f0ea5d0c7740fb489b779ab6074910f02e7711eff76de67e7cd5  laptop.img\n"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
